# oracle: kspace_style ewald/dipole/spin pressure tensor: pair spin/dipole/long 4.0 + ewald/dipole/spin with fixed G-ewald 0.6 and kmax 5, bcc iron 3x3x3 cells (54 random spins, displaced), nve/spin lattice moving, 10 steps with pxx..pyz; the k-space pxy, pxz, pyz follow native's unsymmetrized dipole virial term
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 8.2e-14, atoms 8.8e-20.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           metal
atom_style      spin
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_modify     map array
lattice         bcc 2.8665
region          box block 0.0 3.0 0.0 3.0 0.0 3.0
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 55.845
set             group all spin/random 11 2.2
displace_atoms  all random 0.1 0.1 0.1 4567
velocity        all create 200 4928459 rot yes dist gaussian
pair_style      spin/dipole/long 4.0
pair_coeff      * * 4.0
neighbor        0.5 bin
kspace_style    ewald/dipole/spin 1.0e-4
kspace_modify   gewald 0.6 kmax/ewald 5 5 5
fix             1 all nve/spin lattice moving
timestep        0.0001
compute         pk all pressure NULL kspace
thermo_style    custom step pe elong press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz c_pk[4] c_pk[5] c_pk[6]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g norm no
thermo          5
run             10
